      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present No. 82 Lanesborough Mews to the North Dublin property market. This bright and spacious three-bedroom, three-bathroom duplex is ideally situated on the first floor within the ever-popular Lanesborough development, offering a superb opportunity for first-time buyers, growing families, and investors alike.\nLanesborough enjoys an exceptionally convenient location adjacent to Charlestown Shopping Centre and is within walking distance of Finglas Village, which offers a wide range of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, sporting facilities, and local amenities. Nearby attractions include IKEA, DCU, The National Botanic Gardens, and Dublin City Centre, while Dublin Airport is just a short drive away. The property is exceptionally well connected with easy access to the M50, M1, Port Tunnel, and Dublin City Centre.\nExcellent public transport links are available on the doorstep, with numerous Dublin Bus routes servicing the area and providing frequent access to the city centre and surrounding area.\nInternal living accommodation is generously proportioned and comprises an entrance hallway, guest bathroom, a large and bright living room with access to a private balcony, and a fully fitted kitchen with ample storage and dining space. Upstairs hosts three spacious double bedrooms, all featuring built-in wardrobes. The master bedroom benefits from an en-suite bathroom with electric shower and a private balcony, while the second double bedroom also enjoys access to a balcony. A fully tiled family bathroom completes the upper floor accommodation.\nNo. 82 comes to the market in excellent condition throughout and boasts double-glazed windows, a monitored alarm system, gas-fired central heating with a modern boiler installed approximately 23 years ago, and one designated parking space.\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to appreciate the size, condition, and superb location of this fantastic home.\nContact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today on 0861985247 or 015411455 to arrange a viewing or register your interest.\n\nAdditional Features\n• c. 110 sqm\n• BER B3\n• Spacious 3-bedroom, 3-bathroom duplex\n• Built 2003\n• Situated on the first floor\n• Built-in wardrobes in all bedrooms\n• Master bedroom with en-suite and electric shower\n• Private balcony off the living room\n• Large bright living room\n• Fully fitted kitchen with dining area\n• Family bathroom and guest bathroom\n• Gas-fired central heating\n• Modern boiler installed approximately 23 years ago\n• Double-glazed windows throughout\n• Alarm system\n• One designated parking space\n• Management fees approximately 2,000 per annum\n• Walking distance to Charlestown Shopping Centre and Finglas Village\n• Close to DCU, IKEA, Botanic Gardens, and numerous schools\n• Excellent Dublin Bus services nearby\n• Easy access to the M50, M1, Port Tunnel, and Dublin City Centre\n• Dublin Airport only minutes away\n• Ideal for first-time buyers, families, and investors\n• Viewing highly advised"
      },
